<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Senchem listing suspended pending statement.</title>
<headline>Senchem listing suspended pending statement.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Monday that chemical group Sentrachem Ltd's listing had been suspended pending an announcement which was expected to be published in local newspapers on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
